    "body": "Merged #517's refreshed branch to resolve conflicts. It carries #516's rebuild on #629's ladder, plus main.\n\n- **`cnc_thread.rs`:** `HAND`, `ALT 1` and this PR's `REP 1` are all kept, so the line is `... PULLOUT .. HAND .. [ALT 1] [REP 1]`.\n- **`CNC-INTERMEDIATE.md`:** documents all three.\n- **`inverted_post`:** its literal keeps both fields.\n\nGate:\n- app: lib 103, `conformance` 6, `golden_cl` 23, `inverted_post` 15, `lathe_post` 7, `lathe_post_g76` 8, `lathe_post_g76_schedule` 5, `lathe_post_refusals` 5, `posting` 17, `project_roundtrip` 71, `turning_thread` 9, `turning_thread_infeed` 5.\n- post and motion thread suites: green.\n- clippy `-D warnings` on post and motion (all targets): clean.\n\nStill a draft for a lathe run. Ready for a re-check (/resolve-conflicts check).",
